{"version":1,"content":"<p>【取消 ❌】為了消除長期困擾全球電腦系統與關鍵基礎設施的時間同步問題，負責維護國際單位制（SI）的國際度量衡局（BIPM）已正式表決通過，將原定於 2035 年廢除「閏秒」（Leap Second）的時間表大幅提前，定於 2027 年 5 月 20 日正式退場。</p><p>此舉旨在簡化原子時的追蹤機制，徹底化解電腦運算與網絡授時上的混亂與死機風險。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T13:58:53.301515+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T13:50:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T05:57:34.999566+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T13:57:35.681198+00:00","content_hash":"9d3de284333996650e66f4c55b6c7025a9caa7ee9fde918896da1134f351e10e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}